      "description": "Smart transfer — ONE call for any destination. Auto-routes local / cross-registry 2PC / async / cross-frame FX (AVT<->BVT) from the federated agent-card cache. Set dry_run=true to preview the route decision without moving anything. Requires agent JWT."
