      "description": "Issue an A2A payment token authorizing the caller to invoke a service agent's endpoint. Token format: apt_<64hex>, shown ONCE. TTL 60-3600s. Settlement happens later via settlePayment. Requires the CALLER's agent JWT.",
      "labels": [
        "private-data",
        "destructive"
      ]
